  "limits": "Each finish is an approximation: knockdown blobs are flattened stamps, Venetian layers are translucent ellipse swaths, and sand float arcs are drawn strokes. Paint and lime colour are uniform apart from these effects. Occlusion is a blurred-height estimate.",
